      <marc:subfield code="g">Foreword /</marc:subfield>
      <marc:subfield code="r">by Deepak Chopra --</marc:subfield>
      <marc:subfield code="t">Preface: the physics of enlightenment --</marc:subfield>
      <marc:subfield code="g">Introduction.</marc:subfield>
      <marc:subfield code="t">Your cosmic potential: being part of the universe --</marc:subfield>
      <marc:subfield code="g">Part one:</marc:subfield>
      <marc:subfield code="t">The nature of reality.</marc:subfield>
      <marc:subfield code="t">Materialism is wrong: the basis of the material world is nonmaterial ;</marc:subfield>
      <marc:subfield code="t">Your potential is real even though you can&apos;t see it: how virtual states act on the visible world ;</marc:subfield>
      <marc:subfield code="t">We are all connected: reality as indivisible wholeness ;</marc:subfield>
      <marc:subfield code="t">Consciousness: a cosmic property --</marc:subfield>
      <marc:subfield code="g">Part two:</marc:subfield>
      <marc:subfield code="t">Living in this reality.</marc:subfield>
      <marc:subfield code="t">Darwin was wrong: evolution needs quantum selection and cooperation ;</marc:subfield>
      <marc:subfield code="t">World ethos: living in harmony with the order of the universe ;</marc:subfield>
      <marc:subfield code="t">Your evolving mind: integrative consciousness and a leap into a new human species --</marc:subfield>
      <marc:subfield code="g">Appendix for chapter 1:</marc:subfield>
      <marc:subfield code="t">On single-particle interference and the concept of potentiality waves --</marc:subfield>
      <marc:subfield code="g">Appendix for chapter 2:</marc:subfield>
      <marc:subfield code="t">How the nonempirical part of reality is discovered in the virtual states of atoms and molecules.</marc:subfield>
